  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/952c967501c582f1911db7fefdaaefa9b6e3f505512624eb925e04e002be5a1f.png] \n\nGiven : (1)/(2) ÷ (1)/(32) - 5 + 50 × 80 = 50\n\nAccording to the question, after interchanging the signs:\n\nOption 1) ÷ and ×\n\n (1)/(2) ÷ (1)/(32) - 5 + 50 × 80 = 50 ⇒ (1)/(2) × (1)/(32) - 5 + 50 ÷ 80 = 50\n\n⇒ (1)/(2) × (1)/(32) - 5 + __**50 ÷ 80**__ = 50\n\n⇒ __**(1)/(2) **____**× (1)/(32)**__ - 5 + 0.625 = 50\n\n⇒ __**(1)/(64) **____**+ 0.625**__ - 5 = 50\n\n⇒ __**(11)/(64) **____**- 5**__ = 50\n\n⇒ -4.82 ≠ 50 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 2) × and -\n\n (1)/(2) ÷ (1)/(32) - 5 + 50 × 80 = 50 ⇒ (1)/(2) ÷ (1)/(32) × 5 + 50 - 80 = 50\n\n⇒ __**(1)/(2) **____**÷ (1)/(32)**__ × 5 + 50 - 80 = 50\n\n⇒ __16____** **____**× 5**__ + 50 - 80 = 50\n\n⇒ __80____** + 50**__ - 80 = 50\n\n⇒ __13____**0 - 80**__ = 50\n\n**⇒ 50 = 50 (LHS = RHS)**\n\nOption 3) + and −\n\n (1)/(2) ÷ (1)/(32) - 5 + 50 × 80 = 50 ⇒ (1)/(2) ÷ (1)/(32) + 5 - 50 × 80 = 50\n\n⇒ __**(1)/(2) **____**÷ (1)/(32)**__ + 5 - 50 × 80 = 50\n\n⇒ 16 + 5 - __**50 × 80**__ = 50\n\n⇒ __**16**____** **____**+ 5**__ - 4000 = 50\n\n⇒ **__21__**__** - 4000**__ = 50\n\n⇒ -3979 ≠ 50 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 4) + and ×\n\n (1)/(2) ÷ (1)/(32) - 5 + 50 × 80 = 50 ⇒ (1)/(2) ÷ (1)/(32) - 5 × 50 + 80 = 50\n\n⇒ __**(1)/(2) **____**÷ (1)/(32)**__ - 5 × 50 + 80 = 50\n\n⇒ 16 - __**5 × 50**__ + 80 = 50\n\n⇒ __**16 + 80**__ - 250 = 50\n\n⇒ __96** - 250**__ = 50\n\n⇒ -154 ≠ 50 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nHence, \"Option 2\" is the correct answer.",
